- `productcatalogservice`：`RESOURCE_SATURATION [cpu_cfs] | Val=1.220s throttled`、`RESOURCE_SATURATION [cpu] | Normal=0.00 cores -> Current=0.14 cores (+5109.4%)`、`LATENCY_DEGRADATION p50 0.31ms -> 243.37ms (+77407.0%)`
- `frontend`（上游调用者）：p50 23.32ms → 926.10ms (+3871.8%)
- `recommendationservice`（上游调用者）：p50 3.37ms → 763.04ms (+22569.1%)
